1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,440
The intent of the product is to harmonize

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:06,040
the desktop experience with the mobile

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,610
experience while bringing the new features

4
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:11,450
to desktop that historically have not

5
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:12,690
been super accessible.

6
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:15,230
But CoinJoin is implemented and working.

7
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:16,610
You can choose how many rounds you

8
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,450
want, everything like that.

9
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:21,050
Shielded pool is also functional and

10
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:22,730
so this is sped up a good bit, but

11
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:25,890
you can see that you can nice and easily

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,910
put money in the shielded pool and

13
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:31,890
then you can send it from shielded to shielded

14
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,250
which is very nice.

15
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,070
You can also register a masternode.

16
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,690
You can very easily just click set

17
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:42,350
up a masternode and you can go through the process.

18
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,690
Once you have a masternode, you are

19
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:46,810
able to go into the governance tab

20
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:48,830
and you're able to vote right here

21
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:51,810
on proposals just like you can in Dash Core.

22
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:54,700
Shared masternodes just landed this morning.

23
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:58,360
So this has made a ton of progress.

24
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:01,540
It is near feature complete, but not quite there.

25
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:05,280
The current plan is for feature completeness

26
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:08,160
on this to come right around the end of November.

27
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,440
Hopefully with everything wrapping

28
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:13,220
up and having a final release or a

29
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:16,840
release in early December that is nice and usable.

